.TH MACHIPC 1 6/18/90
.CM 4
.SH NAME
machipc \- measure Mach IPC performance
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmachipc\fP \fB-s\fP
.PP
\fBmachipc\fP \fB-c\fP [\fB-i\fP iterations]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fImachipc(1)\fR is used to measure Mach IPC performance.
Currently, it only measures round-trip times for simple cross-address
space RPCs.
.PP
To use the program, first start the program with
the -s option, in the background.  Then run the program with
the -c option.  The -i option can also be supplied to control
the number of iterations.
